<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — GreaterKraytDragon creature port (Pass 12).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `GreaterKraytDragon` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713),
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `GreaterKraytDragon` BodyDef needs its tail part
  repointed to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B `RSW_SW_Spikes` BodyPartDef and
  `RSW_SWTailAttackTool` BodyPartGroupDef — every other part vanilla Core.
  Ported as RSW_GreaterKraytDragon (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  New resources: `RSW_Leather_KraytDragon` (texPath swresource/Leather_Scaled
  — already extracted, Wave B, reused unchanged), `RSW_Krayt_Meat` (texPath
  swresource/Meat_Krayt, newly extracted), 2 new eggs
  (RSW_EggGreaterKraytDragonFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath
  swresource/EggSpiked, newly extracted), and its butcher-body-part trophy
  (RSW_KraytPearl, texPath swresource/Trophies/KraytPearl, newly extracted).
  All in RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml.

  Ability: PawnKindDef `<abilities>` references `SW_Calamity` directly (not
  via `specialTrainables` like every other Wave C ability) — an
  AbilityDef+HediffDef+TrainableDef trio, ported as RSW_SW_Calamity
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Abilities.xml). soundCast repoints to the already-absorbed
  RSW_Ability_Calamity (589-sound wave, 2026-09-02).

  🔴 **Real donor bug found and fixed, not silently carried over** (same
  category as Igitz's missing swimming texture, 2026-09-12): the donor's own
  PawnKindDef spells the first (hatchling) lifeStage's
  `dessicatedBodyGraphicData` texPath as
  `swanimals/KGreaterKraytDragon/GreaterKraytDragon_Dessicated` — an extra
  leading `K` on the folder segment that exists nowhere else (the other 2
  lifeStages, and every other texPath on this species, correctly use
  `swanimals/GreaterKraytDragon/...`). Confirmed via extract_bundle.py's
  list mode: no `KGreaterKraytDragon*` texture exists anywhere in the
  AssetBundle, only `GreaterKraytDragon_Dessicated`. This is a donor typo —
  the donor mod itself would render the hatchling's dessicated corpse as a
  pink placeholder today. Fixed here by repointing to the correct
  `swanimals/GreaterKraytDragon/GreaterKraytDragon_Dessicated` path (the same
  one the other 2 lifeStages already use), not carried over verbatim.

  🔑 **`canCrossBreedWith` updated, Pass 14 (2026-09-18)**: `KraytDragon`
  repointed to `RSW_KraytDragon` now that species is ported (same pass);
  `KellDragon` stays bare, still unported, same "leave pointing at
  still-bare donor names" precedent as RSW_FeralGrazer's canCrossBreedWith
  (2026-09-17). Flagged here for whoever ports KellDragon next.

  🔴 **ArtOverride collision avoided, checked BEFORE extracting anything**:
  `GreaterKraytDragonArtOverride` (mandrake.rsw.greaterkraytdragonartoverride)
  exists and covers `GreaterKraytDragon_{east,north,south}` (the primary
  look, all 3 life stages — the override's own About.xml says the
  dessicated-corpse texture stays on donor art). Per the Dragonsnake/Anooba
  same-path-collision trap (2026-09-12 finding), SWBestiary ships ONLY
  `GreaterKraytDragon_Dessicated` — the base facing is NOT extracted here.

  Art: 1 PNG extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live
  Steam workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) —
  GreaterKraytDragon_Dessicated, confirmed non-zero and PIL-openable. Sits
  at Textures/swanimals/GreaterKraytDragon/.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
  ground truth.
-->
<Defs>
